Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  艾迪{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, Eddie. Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你在这里做什么  没事  看你睡觉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What are you doing here? Watching you sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那让我觉得很宁静{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It makes me feel, um, peaceful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}请继续{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha, ha. Ahem. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}现在我睡不着了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't sleep now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你要我唱歌给你听吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, you want me to sing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  听着{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}够了  我要你立刻离开这间公寓{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's it. I want you out of the apartment now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你在胡说什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, what are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}人魔汉尼拔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hannibal Lecter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他比你更适合当室友{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Better roommate than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我觉得你不公平  某天晚上你看到我  觉得很可怕{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't think you're being fair! One night you see me, you get scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.19,0:00:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你没看到我的那些晚上呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What about the other nights when you don't see me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}昨晚你起床喝水{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Last night you went and got some water...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我好心地躲在门后  那又如何{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and I was nice enough to hide behind the door. What that about, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I didn't realize that. Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}快给我滚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Get out now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  你真的要我滚吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay. You really want me out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  请滚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要听你说你要我滚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then I want to hear you say you want me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要你滚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I want you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要听你亲口说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I want to hear it from your lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那之前你从哪里听来的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Where'd you hear it before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  你知道吗  就当我已经滚了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, right, all right. You know what? Consider me gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}明天你下班回来会发现我不在了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'll be out by the time you get home from work tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢  我听到了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thank you. I heard that.{\r}
