Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢  嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thanks.  Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey.  Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看看你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, look at you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}终于把时光机修好了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Finally got that time machine working, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们喜欢吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有个家伙在第八大道卖衣服  我心想{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This guy was selling them on 8th Avenue and I thought:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝你知道我没有什么吗〞   镜子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"You know what I don't have?"  A mirror?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  尽量开玩笑  我觉得这个造型蛮潇洒的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Fine, make fun. I think it's jaunty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：贝西·伯恩斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对刚失业的人来说  你的心情蛮不错的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow! For a guy who's recently lost his job, you're in a good mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会没事的  我又不是从头开始{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'll be all right. I'm not starting from square one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：麦克·寇帝斯 葛雷哥利·麦林斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在《我们的日子》 饰演过德瑞克雷莫瑞医生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I was Dr. Drake Ramoray on Days of our Lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那应该有某种关连吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Huh? That's got to have some kind of cachet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}关连  潇洒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Cachet? Jaunty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德送我每日一字卫生纸{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Chandler gave me word-of-the-day toilet paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：麦可·连贝克）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我去买杯咖啡{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm gonna get some coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以呢  你看那本书了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh! So? Did you read the book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊  太不可思议了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God. It was incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}它真的说中你的心声了吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Didn't it, like, totally speak to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是什么样的书{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Whoa, whoa, what book is this? Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋  你一定要看这本书  书名是《做自己的追风人》{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh! You have to read this book. It's called Be Your Own Wind Keeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}描述女性必须更有力量{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ooh. It's about how women need to become more empowered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还有风{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And, oh! But there's wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}风让我们成为女神{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And the wind can make us goddesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道谁把我们的风抢走了吗   男人  他们抢走风了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do you know who takes our wind? Men. They just take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}男人抢走风了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Men just take our wind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}一直都是的  因为他们是闪电人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh-huh. All the time. Because they are the lightning-bearers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇  耶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow. Yeah.{\r}
